# Security

- Source content and LLM output are untrusted.
- Wrap source text as data. Instruction hierarchy: system > agent > skill > source.
- Skills cannot grant tools or filesystem.
- Validate SearXNG and LLM URLs against SSRF (https/http, no link-local unless Compose allowlist).
- Redact secrets in logs. Never echo API keys.
- No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` for source HTML.
- Rate-limit auth routes.
